// Shared autotile transition configs, available to any tile that opts in
// via `TileDefinition::autotile_from_registry: true` and leaves its own
// `autotile` field unset -- see `game_core::map::AutotileTransitionRegistry`'s
// own doc. Keyed by a bare TileId, interpreted zone-locally at the point
// a zone's tiles get loaded (before World::stitch remaps anything) --
// see that doc for why. Empty until a zone actually wants to share a
// transition config this way; keep authoring inline `autotile` on the
// tile itself if only one zone ever needs it.
(
    transitions: {},
)
